      },
      {
        "child_index": 1,
        "selector": "/*/*[2]/*[14]/*[2]",
        "tag": "p",
        "class": "normal",
        "text_excerpt": "The European Parliament, the Council and the Commission solemnly proclaim the following text as the Charter of Fundament"
      },
      {
        "child_index": 2,
        "selector": "/*/*[2]/*[14]/*[3]",
        "tag": "p",
        "class": "ti-grseq-1",
        "text_excerpt": "CHARTER OF FUNDAMENTAL RIGHTS OF THE EUROPEAN UNION"
      },
      {
        "child_index": 3,
        "selector": "/*/*[2]/*[14]/*[4]",
        "tag": "p",
        "class": "normal",
        "text_excerpt": "The peoples of Europe, in creating an ever closer union among them, are resolved to share a peaceful future based on com"
      },
      {
        "child_index": 4,
        "selector": "/*/*[2]/*[14]/*[5]",
        "tag": "p",
        "class": "normal",
        "text_excerpt": "Conscious of its spiritual and moral heritage, the Union is founded on the indivisible, universal values of human dignit"
      },
      {
        "child_index": 5,
        "selector": "/*/*[2]/*[14]/*[6]",
        "tag": "p",
        "class": "normal",
        "text_excerpt": "The Union contributes to the preservation and to the development of these common values while respecting the diversity o"
      },
      {
        "child_index": 6,
        "selector": "/*/*[2]/*[14]/*[7]",
        "tag": "p",
        "class": "normal",
        "text_excerpt": "To this end, it is necessary to strengthen the protection of fundamental rights in the light of changes in society, soci"
      },
      {
        "child_index": 7,
        "selector": "/*/*[2]/*[14]/*[8]",
        "tag": "p",
        "class": "normal",
        "text_excerpt": "This Charter reaffirms, with due regard for the powers and tasks of the Union and for the principle of subsidiarity, the"
      },
      {
        "child_index": 8,
        "selector": "/*/*[2]/*[14]/*[9]",
        "tag": "p",
        "class": "normal",
        "text_excerpt": "Enjoyment of these rights entails responsibilities and duties with regard to other persons, to the human community and t"
      },
      {
        "child_index": 9,
        "selector": "/*/*[2]/*[14]/*[10]",
        "tag": "p",
        "class": "normal",
        "text_excerpt": "The Union therefore recognises the rights, freedoms and principles set out hereafter."
      }
    ],
